## Findings
The Player Ship, Enemies, and Drones were handled by EntityRenderSystem, which was not registered in the ECS world. This has been corrected.
The Shield Ripple VFX had an unresolved enum reference which was corrected in the previous build fix.
The Ripple type in ParticleComponent now has a dedicated draw path in RenderSystem to restore the circular 'ripple' appearance.
